<div class="ev-static"><table class="ev-table"><thead><tr><th>Application</th><th align="center">Int</th><th align="center">§</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#app-simple-abeyance">Simple Abeyance</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§1B1</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-abeyance">Abeyance</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§1B2</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-master-abeyance">Master Abeyance</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§1A3</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-external-link">External Link</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§1A4</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="ev-cards"><section class="ev-card" id="app-simple-abeyance"><h3>Simple Abeyance</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§1B1</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>abeyance</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Delay the whole or a part of the magical effect of which this application is part by up to 30s (<strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-abeyance"><h3>Abeyance</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§1B2</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>abeyance</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Delay the whole or a part of the magical effect of which this application is part by up to one day (<strong>controlled</strong> or <strong>fixed</strong>, <strong>bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-master-abeyance"><h3>Master Abeyance</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§1A3</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>abeyance</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Delay a magical effect of which this application is part indefinitely (<strong>controlled</strong> or <strong>fixed</strong>, <strong>bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-external-link"><h3>External Link</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§1A4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>abeyance</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Delay a magical effect's starting to work until another effect is incorporated into it.

The subsequently incorporated effect must be prespecified (although it can, itself, include this application), and the behaviour of the completed effect must be determined in advance.

Once a new magical effect is incorporated into an effect with an external link, the link is sealed (disappears), and the two combine to form a single magical effect, which starts functioning straight away.

This application is designed to allow a group of magicians to build complex effects, combining their knowledge and skills, or to allow a single magician to produce a difficult effect in stages. As such, it is particularly useful if the 'flashy magic' option is not in use.

(Duration: 24h.)</p></section></div></div>
</div>
<!-- /magic-apps -->

# Air
<!--{ "parent": "magic", "order": 2 }-->

*command and conjure air, wind, and gases*

A **Fundamental** — a Field of Magical Knowledge whose applications reach **40m** and last **2min**; the usual props are **a fan (or perhaps even an ardent admirer)**. Learn it **Basic** (1 yr) for the easy end, **Advanced** (3 yr) for the deep.

Its **12 applications**, by intensity:

<!-- magic-apps: Air -->
<div class="entity-view">
<style>
.ev-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 1.5em;font-size:.92em}
.ev-table th,.ev-table td{border:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,.3);padding:.35em .5em;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
.ev-table th{font-size:.78em;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}
.ev-cards{display:grid;gap:1em;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr))}
.ev-card{border:1px solid rgba(128,128,128,.3);border-radius:8px;padding:.75em 1em;break-inside:avoid;page-break-inside:avoid}
.ev-card h3{margin:0 0 .4em}
.ev-fields{margin:0 0 .6em}
