t his/her target with a magical backfire (roll on the Magical Backfire Table, treating any roll of 01-62 as: the target is stunned, and must recover normally; Duration: <strong>immediate</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-master-teleportation-seal"><h3>Master Teleportation Seal</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§4A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>cancellation</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Render a volume up to 10m×10m×10m impervious to either entry or exit via &quot;teleportation&quot; applications of the Apportation fundamental (<strong>bestowed</strong>, Duration: 1 day).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-lesser-curse-removal"><h3>Lesser Curse Removal</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§4A7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>cancellation</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may remove the effects of a magical backfire (other than an effect reversal) from him/herself or his/her target (Duration: <strong>immediate</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-master-gate-seal"><h3>Master Gate Seal</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§4A8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>cancellation</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Render a volume up to 10m×10m×10m impervious to either entry or exit via &quot;gate&quot; applications — even via existing gates — of the Apportation fundamental (<strong>bestowed</strong>, Duration: 1 day).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-neutralization"><h3>Neutralization</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§4A10</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>cancellation</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may neutralise a single magical effect of intensity ≤ n which is within 10m, but in doing so immediately suffers a (D20) backfire (<strong>immediate</strong>).*

Note: if an attempt to remove a curse (such as caused by some applications of the Tap fundamental) achieves a QR10, then the intensity of the curse is increased by one in addition to the usual ill effects.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divination-block"><h3>Divination Block</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§4A9</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>cancellation</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may render one target immune to location via applications of the Divination fundamental for the effect's duration (<strong>bestowed</strong>).</p></section></div></div>
