 a target within range able to understand the speech of one other target within range for the duration of the effect (<strong>bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-goldenear"><h3>Goldenear</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§5A4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>communication</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker becomes able to detect any untruth knowingly told to him/her.

