<div class="ev-static"><table class="ev-table"><thead><tr><th>Application</th><th align="center">Int</th><th align="center">§</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#app-minor-divination">Minor Divination</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§7B1</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-divine-art">Divine Art</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§7B2</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-divine-text">Divine Text</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§7B3</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-divine-weather">Divine Weather</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§7B4</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-confer-understanding">Confer Understanding</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§7A5</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-divine-past">Divine Past</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§7A6</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-divine-presence">Divine Presence</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§7A7</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-divine-direction">Divine Direction</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§7A8</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-divine-location">Divine Location</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§7A10</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-divine-form">Divine Form</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§7A9</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-divine-surroundings">Divine Surroundings</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§7A11</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-divine-exact-location">Divine Exact Location</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§7A12</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-ask">Ask</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§7A13</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-question">Question</a></td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">§7A14</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="ev-cards"><section class="ev-card" id="app-minor-divination"><h3>Minor Divination</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7B1</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Determine the physical nature of an object; or the race, sex, and age of a character. (Range: 10m.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divine-art"><h3>Divine Art</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7B2</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Determine the normal manner of use of an object; or the social standing and profession of a character. (Range: touch.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divine-text"><h3>Divine Text</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7B3</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker can, assuming he/she is literate, understand writing in an arbitrary language. (Duration: 10min.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divine-weather"><h3>Divine Weather</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7B4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may determine what weather conditions over the succeeding 10h will be.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-confer-understanding"><h3>Confer Understanding</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7A5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Divine Text (§7B3), but <strong>bestowed</strong>.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divine-past"><h3>Divine Past</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Determine the general history of an object. (Range: touch.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divine-presence"><h3>Divine Presence</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7A7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Determine whether or not an object/substance of a particular type exists within 10km.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divine-direction"><h3>Divine Direction</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7A8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Determine in what direction the nearest object/substance of a particular type lies. (Range: 1km.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divine-location"><h3>Divine Location</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7A10</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Determine the direction and distance to an object of a particular type within range. (Range: 1km.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divine-form"><h3>Divine Form</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7A9</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Determine the inner workings and purpose of an object. (Range: touch.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divine-surroundings"><h3>Divine Surroundings</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7A11</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Acquire a description of the surroundings of a specific object. (Range: infinite.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-divine-exact-location"><h3>Divine Exact Location</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7A12</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Determine the physical position of a specific object. (Range: infinite.) !!!</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-ask"><h3>Ask</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7A13</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Gain a single-word reply (you can call it an answer if you're optimistic) to a question of the invoker's choice.

If the answer cannot be expressed in one word, or if the question is poorly defined (eg. if the GM can't understand it, or doesn't want to answer it), then no reply is forthcoming. (Range: infinite.)* !!!</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-question"><h3>Question</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>6</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§7A14</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>divination</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Gain a single-clause reply to a question of the invoker's choice. Otherwise as per Ask (§7A13).<em> !!!

</em> The ramifications of these two applications are fairly broad, and a wise GM may wish to nobble them (see the note concerning applications marked '!!!'), or be extremely ornery in determining what constitutes a well-defined question. Recommended reading for this includes H.W. Fowler's Modern English Usage.</p></section></div></div>
