rotection against Fire</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12B3</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Reduce all damage to one target not larger than 2m×2m×2m from fire, and other heating and/or drying effects, by 4 DCs (<strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>).

Damage inflicted via one or the other and something else (eg. lightning is hot and wet) is reduced by 2 DCs.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-fire"><h3>Fire</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12B4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a flame equivalent to a large campfire, filling one hex (<strong>DC3</strong>, or <strong>DC1</strong> to three locations), and those adjacent to it (<strong>DC1</strong>; <strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-ball-of-fire"><h3>Ball of Fire</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12A5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a fiery explosion (<strong>immediate, bestowed</strong>):

- <strong>DC5</strong> to anyone in the hex targeted;
- <strong>DC4</strong> to those in hexes adjacent to that hex;
- <strong>DC2</strong> to those in hexes two hexes from it.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-fire-storm"><h3>Fire Storm</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Fill a volume up to 5m×5m×5m with flame inflicting <strong>DC3</strong> on those entering it (<strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-summon-fire-elemental"><h3>Summon Fire Elemental</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12A7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Summon an elemental of fire (<strong>controlled</strong>). The elemental appears in 2×(QR-1) pulses. See [5.2].</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-greater-fire-ball"><h3>Greater Fire Ball</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12A8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a fiery explosion (<strong>immediate, bestowed</strong>):

- <strong>DC6</strong> to anyone in the hex targeted, or hexes adjacent to it;
- <strong>DC4</strong> to anyone in hexes two hexes away;
- <strong>DC2</strong> to anyone three hexes away.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-incineration"><h3>Incineration</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12A9</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Intensely heat and dry one target within range (to the effect of causing it <strong>DC13</strong>, which is unlucky). (<strong>Immediate</strong>.)</p></section></div></div>
