ages</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Brighten or dim one lamp, equivalent to a torch or lantern (so that it becomes twice as bright, or ceases to give off light; <strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-image-manipulation"><h3>Image Manipulation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§13B4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>images</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Alter the appearance of any object up to 5m×5m×5m without altering any of its dimensions or volume by more than 10% (<strong>controlled</strong>, so that the changed appearance may not only be altered, but seem to move, etc.).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bestowed-light"><h3>Bestowed Light</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§13B5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>images</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Any Intensity 0 application, <strong>bestowed</strong>.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-image-creation"><h3>Image Creation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§13A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>images</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create/remove an image up to 3m×3m×3m (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bestowed-image-manipulation"><h3>Bestowed Image Manipulation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§13A7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>images</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Any Intensity 1 application, <strong>bestowed</strong>.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bestowed-image-creation"><h3>Bestowed Image Creation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§13A8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>images</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Any Intensity 2 application, <strong>bestowed</strong>.

