</dt><dd>odours&amp;tastes</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Simulate the scent of some object or creature, sufficient to fool a person, within a 5m×5m×5m volume (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-stench"><h3>Stench</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§15B5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>odours&amp;tastes</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Produce an intense and nauseating scent (say skunk oil or burning rubber) causing all in the affected region (up to 5m×5m×5m) to make PR rolls or become stunned (<strong>fixed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-mimic-scent-hound-proof"><h3>Mimic Scent (Hound-proof)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§15A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>odours&amp;tastes</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Simulate the scent of some sort of object or creature, sufficiently well to fool a dog, within a 5m×5m×5m volume (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section></div></div>
