</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Any Intensity 0 application, <strong>bestowed</strong>.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-voice"><h3>Voice</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Audible voice (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-animal-noises"><h3>Animal Noises</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Animal noises — roars, barks, clip-clops, neighs, etc. (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-footsteps"><h3>Footsteps</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Sound of an unarmoured person — clothes rustling, footfalls, breathing, etc. (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-sounds-of-burning"><h3>Sounds of Burning</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B9</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Sounds of burning — hissing, crackling, etc. (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-thunderclap"><h3>Thunderclap</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19A12</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Sound of a huge impact or explosion, or other sound of similar volume (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-greater-silence"><h3>Greater Silence</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19A13</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Silence any bearable sound (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bestowed-sound"><h3>Bestowed Sound</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19A14</dd><dt>Sour