<div class="ev-static"><table class="ev-table"><thead><tr><th>Application</th><th align="center">Int</th><th align="center">§</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#app-create-wood">Create Wood</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§25B1</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-expand-wood">Expand Wood</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§25B2</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-contract-wood">Contract Wood</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§25B3</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-create-great-wood">Create Great Wood</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§25A4</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-mature-plant">Mature Plant</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§25A5</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-animate-plant">Animate Plant</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§25A6</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-carve-wood">Carve Wood</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§25A7</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="ev-cards"><section class="ev-card" id="app-create-wood"><h3>Create Wood</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§25B1</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>wood</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a piece of wood (equivalent to any naturally occurring kind) ≤0.5m×0.5m×4m.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-expand-wood"><h3>Expand Wood</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§25B2</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>wood</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Expand a wooden object ≤2m×2m×2m by increasing its linear dimensions by up to 100%. The object's mass remains constant, so that normal wood would become as light as balsa, while its strength is unchanged.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-contract-wood"><h3>Contract Wood</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§25B3</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>wood</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Contract a wooden object ≤2m×2m×2m by reducing its linear dimensions by up to 50%. The object's mass remains constant, while its strength and density increase markedly.

- If armour is made out of such wood, it will be as metal armour of the equivalent type, but with protection values one worse in each category.
- A weapon normally made of metal may be made of this material, but will have its DCs reduced by one.
- A weapon normally made of wood may be made of this material, in which case its DCs are improved by one, while its mass is increased by 50%.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-create-great-wood"><h3>Create Great Wood</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§25A4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>wood</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a piece of wood (equivalent to any naturally occurring kind) ≤1m×1m×20m.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-mature-plant"><h3>Mature Plant</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§25A5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>wood</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Rapidly mature a plant (so that it undergoes the equivalent of five years of growth during ten minutes).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-animate-plant"><h3>Animate Plant</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§25A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>wood</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Animate a plant no larger than 2m×2m×2m. It will have the fighting abilities and mobility of a zombie, with DT = height in m, and DC = height in m + 1.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-carve-wood"><h3>Carve Wood</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§25A7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>wood</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may instantly transform a piece of wood into anything into which it could be made by skilled carpenters given time. (Range: touch.)</p></section></div></div>
</div>
